    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταίρω</span></b> , 
			Aeol.
		 (also in Trag.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδ-</span></b> ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lift up and remove,
			shift</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαλμα ἐκ βάθρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					1157
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδαίρειν κῶλον, πόδα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HF</u>
				819
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				872
			</span></i> (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τόπων νέους πεδαίρουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1027
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναθέματα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				573.15
			</span></i> (Cilicia, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				37.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>repeal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήφισμα μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.174
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>depart</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεῖθεν</span>”
